  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has release the Gr-III Result for the post of Technician Grade-I (CEN No. 02/2025) on its official website. This recruitment was conducted for a total of 6,238 posts. The application process for RRB Technician Grade-I &amp; Grade-III Recruitment 2025 was carried out from 28 June 2025 to 07 August 2025. The CBT examination was conducted from 06 to 13 March 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their Railway RRB Technician Gr-III Result 2026 from the link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (Ministry of Railway)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RRB Technician Gr-III Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB Technician Advt No. : (CEN). No. 02/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>28 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>07 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>07 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Edit/ Modify Form : <strong>10-19 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status : <strong>08 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Revised Exam Date :<strong> 06, 09, 10 &amp; 13 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>26 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>02 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key (Technician Gr-III) : <strong>19 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key (Gr-I) : <strong>22 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key (Gr-I) : <strong>28 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result (Gr-I) : <strong>21 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result (Gr-III) : <strong>29 May 2026 Available Now</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :<strong> Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><str