\"text-align: center; width: 51.4864%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">RRB Ranchi SER</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 47.4325%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">35</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 51.4864%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">RRB Secunderabad ECOR / SCR</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 47.4325%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">113</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 51.4864%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">RRB Siliuguri NFR</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 47.4325%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">133</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 51.4864%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">RRB Thiruvanathapuram SR</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 47.4325%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">197</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 100.27%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Technician Grade I Signal :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree of Science in Physics / Electronics / Computer Science / Information Technology / Instrumentation <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">B.SC in a Combination of Any Sub Stream of Physics / Electronics / Computer Science / IT / Instrumentation <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech / 3 Year Engineering Polytechnic Diploma in Above Basic Stream.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Technician Grade III :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For S&amp;T Trade</strong> – Candidates who have passed 10+2 with Physics and Math OR Class 10th with ITI Certificate from NCVT / SCVT will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Other Trades – </strong>Candidates who have passed Class 10th with ITI Certificate from NCVT / SCVT in Related Trade / Branch will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Technician Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check Railway RRB Technician Gr-III Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the <strong>Important Links</strong> section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the <strong>Download Gr-III Result</strong> link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</s